            "code": "# scan for sign changes\nxs=[-10+i*0.01 for i in range(2001)]\nsign_changes=[]\nprev=f(xs[0])\nfor x in xs[1:]:\n    cur=f(x)\n    if prev==0: sign_changes.append((x,x))\n    if cur==0 or prev*cur<0:\n        sign_changes.append((x-0.01,x))\n    prev=cur\nsign_changes[:10], len(sign_changes)\n",
